{"id":"n87783-1-8","stage":4,"title":"허물다 · 倒塌","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87783-1-8-1","ko":"이런 모양으로 만들려고 했던 게 아닌데.","zh":"我本来不是想做成这个样子的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이런","meaning":"这样的","explanation":"이런：这样的","readings":[{"term":"이런","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17869","senseId":"1","lemma":"이런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모양으로","meaning":"样子","explanation":"모양：样子；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62397","senseId":"6","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만들려고","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했던","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아닌데.","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"아닌데","audio":"/audio/13eefb34913c170ce9ba.mp3"}],"sources":[]}],"words":[{"id":"82a16d424583893e","term":"이런","zh":"这样的","audio":"/audio/82a16d424583893ed663.mp3","entryId":"17869","definition":"状态、样子、性质等这样的。","pronunciation":["이런"]},{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"样子","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62397","definition":"某种方式或方法。","pronunciation":["모양"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"打算做（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]}],"audio":"/audio/f3449c6bf4556e3de792.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87783-1-8-2","ko":"그럼 다 허물고 다시 만들어 봐.","zh":"那就把现有的都拆了，重新做一次吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"허물고","meaning":"倒塌，坍塌","explanation":"허물다：倒塌，坍塌；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"허물다","audio":"/audio/20048ca391803f97d59a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87783","senseId":"1","lemma":"허물다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다시","meaning":"又，重新","explanation":"다시：又，重新","readings":[{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62539","senseId":"6","lemma":"다시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만들어","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"20048ca391803f97","term":"허물다","zh":"倒塌，坍塌","audio":"/audio/20048ca391803f97d59a.mp3","entryId":"87783","definition":"堆起来或加起来的东西老旧而倒塌。","pronunciation":["허물다"]},{"id":"920b0d402f08f1fb","term":"다시","zh":"又，重新","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3","entryId":"62539","definition":"从头开始重做。","pronunciation":["다시"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d91081aec43209685cf9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.9,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87783","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":139,"sequenceScore":2.7267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我本来不是想做成这个样子的。","那就把现有的都拆了，重新做一次吧。","这个寒假你有制定计划吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我本来不是想做成这个样子的。","那就把现有的都拆了，重新做一次吧。","这个寒假你有制定计划吗？"],"answer":1}]}
